  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6800 PRELIMINARY BREATH TEST DEVICES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Saf-C 6800 PRELIMINARY BREATH TEST DEVICES\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 265-A: 15, III\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nPursuant to 2003, 319:80, II, effective 1-1-04, rules He-P 2206 entitled “Preliminary Breath Test Devices”, last filed by the Department of Health and Human Services under Document #7781, effective 10-23-02, were transferred to the Department of Safety. The Department of Safety subsequently filed Document #9685, effective 3-23-10, which readopted with amendments and renumbered He-P 2206 as Saf-C 6800.\n\nThe rules in Document #9685 replaced all prior filings for rules in the former He-P 2206. The filings of the Department of Health and Human Services or its Division of Public Health Services affecting the former He-P 2206 include the following documents:\n\n#2309, eff 1-1-83\n\n#2340, eff 4-1-83\n\n#2476, eff 9-14-83\n\n#3068, eff 7-23-85\n\n#4044, eff 4-25-86, EXPIRED 4-25-92\n\n#7781, eff 10-23-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6800.html"
}
